    "duration_raw": "10 min./level or until discharged",
    "saving_throw_raw": "Will negates (harmless)",
    "spell_resistance_raw": "yes (harmless)",
    "description_raw": "The warded creature gains resistance to blows, cuts, stabs, and slashes. The subject gains DR 10/adamantine. It ignores the first 10 points of damage each time it takes damage from a weapon, though an adamantine weapon bypasses the reduction. Once the spell has prevented a total of 10 points of damage per caster level (maximum 150 points), it is discharged.\nStoneskin, Communal\nSchool abjuration; Level alchemist 5, druid 6, inquisitor 5, sorcerer/wizard 5, summoner 4, unchained summoner 5",
